---
import '../styles/pc-globe.css';
---
<section class="pc-globe" data-pc-globe data-palette="ega" hidden aria-label="PC Globe visitor atlas">
 <header class="pc-titlebar"><span aria-hidden="true">▣</span><h2>PC GLOBE</h2><span class="pc-edition">VISITOR EDITION</span><button data-pc-expand aria-label="Expand PC Globe" aria-pressed="false">▣</button></header>
 <div class="pc-menubar"><span>World atlas · 1987</span><button data-pc-help-toggle aria-expanded="false">Help / About</button></div>
 <div class="pc-commandbar"><label>DATA<select data-pc-period aria-label="PC Globe traffic period"><option value="history">Sample Jetpack</option><option value="now">Right now</option><option value="today">Today</option><option value="recovered">Sample recovered</option></select></label><label>DISPLAY<select data-pc-palette aria-label="PC Globe display theme"><option value="ega">EGA colour</option><option value="cga">CGA cyan / magenta</option><option value="amber">Amber monitor</option></select></label></div>
 <div class="pc-map-heading"><strong>WORLD VISITOR ATLAS</strong><span data-pc-map-caption>COUNTRY TOTALS</span></div>
 <div class="pc-map-shell"><svg class="pc-map" data-pc-map viewBox="0 0 720 360" role="group" aria-label="Interactive visitor atlas. Select a country or visitor pin; use the country selector for keyboard access." tabindex="0"><g data-pc-grid aria-hidden="true"></g><g data-pc-land></g><g data-pc-pins></g></svg><p class="pc-loading" data-pc-loading role="status">Reading WORLD.DAT…</p><div class="pc-map-tools" role="group" aria-label="PC Globe map controls"><button data-pc-zoom="in" aria-label="Zoom PC Globe map in">+</button><button data-pc-zoom="out" aria-label="Zoom PC Globe map out">−</button><button data-pc-zoom="reset">World</button><button data-pc-home>Home</button></div></div>
 <div class="pc-overlays" role="group" aria-label="PC Globe map overlays"><button data-pc-overlay="visitors" aria-pressed="true">◆ Visitors</button><button data-pc-overlay="flags" aria-pressed="true">⚑ Flags</button><button data-pc-overlay="grid" aria-pressed="true"># Grid</button><button data-pc-overlay="home" aria-pressed="true">⌂ Home / You</button></div>
 <p class="pc-map-key"><span>◆ Country totals</span><span>● Live locations</span><span>⌂ Home</span><span>◎ You</span></p>
 <div class="pc-readouts"><div><strong data-pc-total>—</strong><span data-pc-total-label>Reported views</span></div><div><strong data-pc-locations>—</strong><span>Mapped locations</span></div><div><strong data-pc-country-count>—</strong><span>Countries / territories</span></div></div>
 <div class="pc-dossier"><div class="pc-dossier-title"><strong>COUNTRY INFORMATION</strong><span data-pc-country-code>CA</span></div><label class="pc-country-search">Find a country<select data-pc-country aria-label="Find a country in PC Globe"><option value="CA">Canada</option></select></label><div class="pc-country-heading"><img data-pc-flag src="/pc-globe/flags/ca.svg" alt="Flag of Canada" width="72" height="54" loading="lazy"/><div><h3 data-pc-country-name>Canada</h3><p data-pc-country-region>Americas · North America</p></div></div><dl class="pc-facts"><div><dt>Capital</dt><dd data-pc-capital>Ottawa</dd></div><div><dt>Area</dt><dd data-pc-area>9,984,670 km²</dd></div><div><dt>Languages</dt><dd data-pc-languages>English, French</dd></div><div><dt>Currency</dt><dd data-pc-currency>CAD · Canadian dollar</dd></div></dl><p class="pc-country-traffic" data-pc-country-traffic>Loading the country report…</p><p class="pc-location-detail" data-pc-location-detail aria-live="polite">Select a country, a visitor dot, or a flag.</p></div>
 <section class="pc-sound" aria-label="PC Globe sound controls"><div class="pc-sound-heading"><strong>♫ SOUND BLASTER–STYLE</strong><button data-pc-sound-toggle aria-pressed="false">Sound: off</button></div><div class="pc-sound-controls"><label>Voice<select data-pc-voice><option value="fm">FM brass</option><option value="bell">FM bell</option><option value="square">PC speaker · 5.04</option></select></label><label>Volume<input data-pc-volume type="range" min="0" max="100" value="30" aria-label="PC Globe volume"/></label></div><div class="pc-player"><button data-pc-anthem disabled>Play anthem</button><label class="pc-theme-select"><select data-pc-theme aria-label="Original PC Globe theme"><option value="voyager">World explorer</option><option value="night">Midnight modem</option></select></label><button data-pc-play-theme>Play theme</button><button data-pc-stop>Stop</button></div><p data-pc-audio-status role="status">16-bit synth · sound starts only when you press play.</p><p class="pc-anthem-credit" data-pc-anthem-credit></p></section>
 <details class="pc-visitors" open><summary>VISITOR DIRECTORY <span data-pc-directory-count></span></summary><div data-pc-directory></div></details>
 <div class="pc-help" data-pc-help hidden><h3>A little window back to childhood.</h3><p>A tribute to PC Globe, first released in 1987, with the DOS / early Windows atlas feel and your visitor data and John’s clearly labeled sample history. Choose a country for its flag and facts, then play its anthem opening. Two original synth themes accompany the journey.</p><p>Drag to pan after zooming. With the map focused, use arrow keys to pan, + / − to zoom, and 0 to see the world. Escape stops audio and closes this panel. Sound also stops when you leave this tab.</p><p>250 country and territory profiles; 43 licensed anthem openings. Small islands missing from the overview map are available in the country menu. Historical totals remain country aggregates. Live pins are approximate city / region estimates; unresolved visitors stay unmapped.</p><p><a href="https://winworldpc.com/product/pc-globe/50" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original PC Globe at WinWorld</a> · <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PC_Globe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The story of PC Globe</a></p><p><a href="https://github.com/mledoze/countries">Country profiles</a> · <a href="https://github.com/lipis/flag-icons">Flag icons</a> · <a href="https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas">Natural Earth map</a> · <a href="/pc-globe/credits.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Audio, data & licenses</a></p></div>
 <details class="pc-city-explorer"><summary>City gazetteer · 503 places</summary><slot /></details>
 <footer class="pc-status"><span data-pc-source role="status">C:\WORLD\VISITORS.DAT</span><span class="pc-ready" data-pc-ready>LOADING</span></footer><p class="pc-data-note" data-pc-data-note></p>
</section>
